I keep drifting through the gaps in time.

528
00:43:08,675 --> 00:43:11,875
知らないわ周りのことなど
I don't care about anything around me,

529
00:43:11,875 --> 00:43:14,875
私は私それだけ
I am just me, and that's all.

530
00:43:15,075 --> 00:43:18,675
夢見てる何も見てない
Dreaming, yet seeing nothing at all,

531
00:43:18,675 --> 00:43:21,875
語るも無駄な自分の言葉
my own words are useless to speak.

532
00:43:21,875 --> 00:43:25,075
悲しむなんて疲れるだけよ
Feeling sad only wears me out,

533
00:43:25,075 --> 00:43:28,375
何も感じず過ごせばいいの
so it's better to live without feeling anything.

534
00:43:28,375 --> 00:43:31,675
戸惑う言葉与えられても
Even when given confusing words,

535
00:43:31,675 --> 00:43:34,875
自分の心ただ上の空
my mind remains completely absent.

536
00:43:34,875 --> 00:43:38,375
もし私から動くのならば
