537
00:43:38,375 --> 00:43:41,875
すべて変えるのなら黒にする
if I were to change everything, I'd paint it black.

538
00:43:41,875 --> 00:43:45,075
こんな自分に未来はあるの？
Is there a future for someone like me?

539
00:43:45,075 --> 00:43:48,375
こんな世界に私はいるの？
Do I even belong in a world like this?

540
00:43:48,375 --> 00:43:51,675
今切ないの？今悲しいの？
Am I in pain right now? Am I sad right now?

541
00:43:51,675 --> 00:43:55,075
自分のことも解らないまま
Without even understanding myself,

542
00:43:55,075 --> 00:43:58,375
歩むことさえ疲れるだけよ
even walking forward just exhausts me.

543
00:43:58,375 --> 00:44:01,675
人のことなど知りもしないわ
I don't know or care about anyone else.

544
00:44:01,675 --> 00:44:05,075
こんな私もし変われるのなら
If even someone like me could change,

545
00:44:05,075 --> 00:44:08,875
もし変われるのなら白になる
if I could change, I would become white.

546
00:44:28,075 --> 00:44:31,375
