554
00:44:52,875 --> 00:44:56,075
夢見てる何も見てない
Dreaming, yet seeing nothing at all,

555
00:44:56,075 --> 00:44:59,375
語るも無駄な自分の言葉
my own words are useless to speak.

556
00:44:59,375 --> 00:45:02,675
悲しむなんて疲れるだけよ
Feeling sad only wears me out.

557
00:45:02,835 --> 00:45:04,935
悲しむなんて 疲れるだけよ
Being sad is just exhausting.

558
00:45:05,135 --> 00:45:08,235
何も感じず過ごせばいいの
I should just live without feeling anything.

559
00:45:08,535 --> 00:45:11,635
