If I were to move on my own,

562
00:45:17,835 --> 00:45:21,035
すべて変えるのなら黒にする
if I were to change everything, I'd make it black.

563
00:45:22,335 --> 00:45:23,835
動くのならば
If I move,

564
00:45:23,935 --> 00:45:25,435
動くのならば
if I move,

565
00:45:25,535 --> 00:45:27,035
すべて壊すわ
I'll destroy everything,

566
00:45:27,135 --> 00:45:28,635
すべて壊すわ
I'll destroy everything.

567
00:45:28,735 --> 00:45:30,235
悲しむならば
If I am to grieve,

568
00:45:30,335 --> 00:45:31,835
悲しむならば
if I am to grieve,

569
00:45:31,935 --> 00:45:33,435
私の心
can my heart

570
00:45:33,535 --> 00:45:35,535
白く変われる？
turn white?

571
00:45:35,635 --> 00:45:37,135
あなたのことも
About you,

572
00:45:37,235 --> 00:45:38,735
私のことも
about me,

573
00:45:38,835 --> 00:45:40,335
すべてのことも
about everything,

574
00:45:40,435 --> 00:45:41,935
まだ知らないの
I still don't know.

575
00:45:42,035 --> 00:45:43,535
重い瞼を
If I open

576
00:45:43,635 --> 00:45:45,135
開けたのならば
my heavy eyelids,

577
00:45:45,235 --> 00:45:46,735
すべて壊すの
if everything is to be destroyed,

578
00:45:46,835 --> 00:45:50,835
なら黒になれ
then turn to black!

579
00:46:46,835 --> 00:46:52,635
いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が
Someday, the light of love you kindle in your eyes

580
00:46:52,835 --> 00:46:54,835
時を超えて
will transcend time,

581
00:46:54,935 --> 00:47:00,135
滅び急ぐ世界の夢を 確かに一つ壊すだろう
and surely destroy one dream of a world hurrying to ruin.

582
00:47:00,335 --> 00:47:03,635
躊躇いを飲み干して
Swallow down your hesitation.

583
00:47:03,835 --> 00:47:07,935
君が望むモノは何？
What is it that you desire?

584
00:47:08,035 --> 00:47:12,335
こんな欲深い憧れの行方に
On the path of such greedy longing,

585
00:47:12,435 --> 00:47:18,335
儚い明日はあるの？
is there a fleeting tomorrow?

586
00:47:19,035 --> 00:47:26,635
子供の頃夢に見てた 古の魔法のように
Like the ancient magic I dreamed of as a child,

587
00:47:26,835 --> 00:47:30,235
闇さえ砕く力で
with power that can shatter even darkness,

588
00:47:30,335 --> 00:47:33,735
微笑む君に会いたい
I want to meet you smiling.

589
00:47:33,835 --> 00:47:37,835
怯えるこの手の中には
In these trembling hands,

590
00:47:37,935 --> 00:47:41,735
手折られた花の勇気
is the courage of a plucked flower.

591
00:47:41,835 --> 00:47:45,335
想いだけが頼る全て
My feelings alone are all I rely on,

592
00:47:45,435 --> 00:47:49,635
光を呼び覚ます
awakening the light...

593
00:47:49,735 --> 00:47:53,835
願い
...my wish.

594
00:47:59,635 --> 00:48:07,035
いつか君も誰かの為に 強い力を望むのだろう
Someday, you too will desire great power for someone's sake, won't you?

595
00:48:07,135 --> 00:48:11,335
愛が胸を捕らえた夜に
On the night when love captures your heart,

596
00:48:11,435 --> 00:48:15,635
未知の言葉が生まれてくる
unknown words will be born.

597
00:48:15,735 --> 00:48:18,635
迷わずに行けるなら
If I can go without hesitation,

598
00:48:18,735 --> 00:48:22,135
心が砕けてもいいわ
I don't mind if my heart breaks into pieces.

599
00:48:22,235 --> 00:48:25,735
いつも目の前の悲しみに
To face the sorrow always before my eyes,

600
00:48:25,835 --> 00:48:30,835
立ち向かう為の呪文が欲しい
I want a spell.

601
00:48:32,335 --> 00:48:35,835
君はまだ夢見る記憶
You are still a memory dreaming,

602
00:48:35,935 --> 00:48:39,435
私は眠らない明日
I am the sleepless tomorrow.

603
00:48:39,535 --> 00:48:43,235
二人が出会う奇跡を
To seize the miracle of our meeting,

604
00:48:43,335 --> 00:48:47,035
勝ち取る為に進むわ
I will press forward.

605
00:48:47,135 --> 00:48:51,135
怯えるこの手の中には
In these trembling hands,

606
00:48:51,235 --> 00:48:55,035
手折られた花の刃
is the blade of a plucked flower.

607
00:48:55,135 --> 00:48:58,635
想いだけが生きる全て
My feelings alone are all that live,

608
00:48:58,735 --> 00:49:02,735
心に振りかざす
brandished in my heart...

609
00:49:02,835 --> 00:49:07,835
願い
...my wish.

610
00:50:04,480 --> 00:50:09,080
囚われた太陽の
Illuminated by captive suns,

611
00:50:09,080 --> 00:50:12,080
輝く
shining...

612
00:50:12,080 --> 00:50:17,080
不思議の国の本が好きだった頃
back when I used to like books about strange lands,

613
00:50:19,480 --> 00:50:22,780
願いはきっと叶うと
I believed the fairy tales

614
00:50:22,780 --> 00:50:26,080
教えてくれたお伽話を
that taught us that wishes

615
00:50:26,080 --> 00:50:28,280
信じた
would surely come true.

616
00:50:28,280 --> 00:50:30,280
光と影の
Among the light and shadow...

617
00:50:30,280 --> 00:50:35,280
中...
within...

618
00:50:42,780 --> 00:50:46,780
静かに咲き乱れていた
Gently, blooming wildly in silence,

619
00:50:46,780 --> 00:50:49,480
古の魔法 優しく
the ancient magic gently...

620
00:50:49,480 --> 00:50:53,280
世界を変える力が
"The power to change the world

621
00:50:53,280 --> 00:50:58,280
その手にあると囁く
lies in those hands of yours," it whispers.

622
00:50:58,280 --> 00:51:02,280
終わらない夢を見よう
Let us have an unending dream.

623
00:51:02,280 --> 00:51:06,080
君と行く時の中で
During this time I go through with you,

624
00:51:06,080 --> 00:51:10,280
想いだけが生きる全て
my feelings alone are all that I live for.

625
00:51:10,280 --> 00:51:14,480
命を作るのは
What creates my life

626
00:51:14,480 --> 00:51:29,280
願い...
is this wish...

627
00:51:44,480 --> 00:51:49,780
うわー！
Whoa!

628
00:51:49,780 --> 00:51:54,280
アキちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう！
Aki-chan, happy birthday!

629
00:51:54,280 --> 00:51:58,780
ありがとう！
Thank you!

630
00:51:59,080 --> 00:52:02,080
今日は来てくれてありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming today!

631
00:52:02,080 --> 00:52:06,080
こちらこそですよ！呼んでくれてありがとう！
Likewise! Thank you for inviting us!

632
00:52:06,280 --> 00:52:11,280
実はね、二人を呼んだのちょっと理由があって
Actually, there's a reason I invited you two today.

633
00:52:11,280 --> 00:52:13,780
おっ、何だ何だ？
Oh? What is it?

634
00:52:13,780 --> 00:52:18,780
前にアキロゼの4周年の時に3人でKalafinaさんの曲を歌わせてもらったんだけど
Back during AkiRose's 4th Anniversary, the three of us sang a Kalafina song together, right?

635
00:52:18,780 --> 00:52:21,280
やりましたね！めっちゃ良かったやつね！
We did! It was so awesome!

636
00:52:21,280 --> 00:52:25,080
ハーモニーがね！
The harmonies, right!

637
00:52:25,080 --> 00:52:32,280
もうね、ミオちゃんの歌も大好きだし、ロボ子さんの歌も大好きだし、もう忘れられないの！
I loved Mio-chan's singing so much, and I loved Roboco-san's singing so much too, I just couldn't forget it!

638
00:52:32,280 --> 00:52:36,280
わかる、わかる！
I get it, I get it!

639
00:52:36,280 --> 00:52:42,780
だからもう一回、ライブステージで3人で歌いたくて、今日は来ていただきました！
So I wanted us three to sing on a live stage together once again, which is why I asked you to come today!

640
00:52:42,780 --> 00:52:46,780
嬉しい！ありがとう！
I'm so happy! Thank you!

641
00:52:47,280 --> 00:52:51,780
だからこれから、これを機に、もっと3人で歌ったりとか…
So taking this opportunity, doing more things like singing as a trio...

642
00:52:51,780 --> 00:52:55,280
なんかそういうの挑戦できたら、めっちゃ嬉しいね！
...or taking on challenges like that would make me so happy!

643
00:52:55,280 --> 00:52:58,280
いいですか？ハーモニーを重ねていきましょうよ！
Is that okay? Let's keep layering our harmonies together!

644
00:52:58,280 --> 00:53:00,280
えー、いいの！？
Eh, really?!

645
00:53:00,280 --> 00:53:04,780
ユニット名とか欲しいな！
I want a unit name or something!

646
00:53:04,780 --> 00:53:09,080
確かに！え、何ならちょっと世界目指せるぐらいの3人だから…
Indeed! I mean, with the three of us, we could even aim for the world...

647
00:53:09,080 --> 00:53:12,480
世界のコンサートをしようよ！
Let's do a world concert tour!

648
00:53:12,480 --> 00:53:16,280
したい、したい！世界に轟く…！
I want to! Resonating across the world...!

649
00:53:16,280 --> 00:53:20,780
何かをね、したいということで！
We want to do something like that!

650
00:53:20,780 --> 00:53:25,780
この3人でライブとか、アコースティックとか、オーケストラライブとか！
Like a live show with the three of us, or acoustic, or an orchestra live!

651
00:53:25,780 --> 00:53:30,280
えー、良くないですか！？我らならできるかもしれない！
Wouldn't that be great?! With us, we might actually be able to do it!

652
00:53:30,280 --> 00:53:34,280
お願いしまーす！
Please!

653
00:53:36,780 --> 00:53:41,280
あれ？これは一体何ですか？
Huh? What in the world is this?

654
00:53:41,280 --> 00:53:45,280
もしかして、このライブでみんなからの…
Could it be that, from everyone during this live...

655
00:53:45,280 --> 00:53:54,280
なんかいいパワーで…
...some kind of great power...

656
00:53:54,280 --> 00:53:57,280
こちらがなんと、完成しました！
...this has actually been completed!

657
00:53:57,280 --> 00:54:01,080
イエーイ！何だそれ！
Yay! What is that?!

658
00:54:01,080 --> 00:54:07,280
実はこの後、アキロゼの新曲が出ます！
Actually, after this, AkiRose's new song will be released!

659
00:54:07,280 --> 00:54:12,280
やったー！出たー！
Yay! It's out!

660
00:54:12,280 --> 00:54:19,780
こちら、今回のライブのテーマというか、壮大なテーマがあるんですけれども
This track embodies the theme—or rather, the grand theme—of today's live stream,

661
00:54:19,780 --> 00:54:24,280
そちらがつまったような楽曲になっています！
packed right into a single song!

662
00:54:24,280 --> 00:54:30,280
そしてライブ終わりの日付が変わる時にリリースしますので、ぜひ聴いてください！
And it will be released when the date changes after this live stream ends, so please listen to it!

663
00:54:30,280 --> 00:54:34,280
聴くぞー！ハイ！
We'll listen! Yay!

664
00:54:35,280 --> 00:54:38,780
ではでは、次の曲に行きますか！
Well then, shall we move on to the next song?

665
00:54:38,780 --> 00:54:42,080
次の曲？新曲のお披露目！
The next song? The reveal of the new song!

666
00:54:42,080 --> 00:54:46,780
なんだってー！？しちゃいます！
What?! We're going to do it!

667
00:54:46,780 --> 00:54:53,280
今から！？今から頑張ります！最後まで見逃せないですね！
Starting now?! Starting now, I'll do my best! You can't miss a single second until the end!

668
00:54:53,280 --> 00:55:00,280
アキちゃん、頑張ってね！ありがとー！
Aki-chan, good luck! Thank you!

669
00:55:09,975 --> 00:55:14,775
魅惑の言葉の裏面に忍ばせた
Hidden behind the alluring words

670
00:55:14,975 --> 00:55:17,575
1mgのスパイス
Is 1mg of spice.

671
00:55:17,575 --> 00:55:22,975
たちまち華麗な指先で彩る
Instantly colored by splendid fingertips,

672
00:55:23,275 --> 00:55:25,775
本日のダイス
Are today's dice.

673
00:55:25,975 --> 00:55:33,275
辺り見て妥協してっちゃ生き残れないでしょう
Looking around and compromising won't let you survive, right?

674
00:55:33,575 --> 00:55:36,975
率直に言ってそう全てが欲しい
To be frank, yes, I want it all!

675
00:55:36,975 --> 00:55:40,775
一人勝ちにオールイン
Going all-in for the solo victory.

676
00:55:42,775 --> 00:55:46,575
どうなっちゃってもいいじゃない 限界なんてないじゃない
Who cares what happens? There are no limits anyway, right?

677
00:55:46,575 --> 00:55:50,975
翻弄して 翻弄されて ゾ・ク・ゾ・ク
Toying with others, being toyed with—gives me thrills and chills.

678
00:55:50,975 --> 00:55:54,775
喰らっちゃっても本懐でしょ 最低だって滾るでしょ
Even if I'm consumed, it's what I wanted; even if it's the worst, it boils my blood, right?

679
00:55:54,775 --> 00:55:58,275
見透かして 見透かされて 故に
Seeing through, being seen through, and therefore...

680
00:55:58,275 --> 00:55:59,275
終わりは無い
...there is no end.

681
00:55:59,275 --> 00:56:02,575
高鳴るこの全てノンフィクション
All of this pounding thrill is non-fiction.

682
00:56:17,775 --> 00:56:25,275
嗜むはずでもたまには飲みすぎて1回休み
I meant to just savor it, but sometimes I drink too much and lose a turn.

683
00:56:25,575 --> 00:56:33,275
周りもザワつく思わぬうたた寝で2回休み
The crowd stirs as an unexpected nap costs me two turns.

684
00:56:33,575 --> 00:56:40,575
切れる頭と勘だけじゃ手に入らないモノ
Things you can't get with just a sharp mind and intuition.

685
00:56:40,775 --> 00:56:44,575
速攻で逝って満たされるならいい
If going out in a quick blitz satisfies me, then so be it.

686
00:56:44,575 --> 00:56:48,775
命懸けで楽しむわ
I'll enjoy this with my life on the line.

687
00:56:56,575 --> 00:57:00,975
天と地は案外近いのぃ 「この通り」 命乞い？
Heaven and earth are surprisingly close. "Like this"—begging for mercy?

688
00:57:00,975 --> 00:57:04,975
たかがモノポリー されど王女に 秘める想いで今宵も私は強い
It's just Monopoly, yet with feelings hidden as a princess, I'm strong tonight too.

689
00:57:07,575 --> 00:57:11,575
どうなっちゃってもいいじゃない 限界なんてないじゃない
Who cares what happens? There are no limits anyway, right?

690
00:57:11,575 --> 00:57:15,775
翻弄して 翻弄されて ゾ・ク・ゾ・ク
Toying with others, being toyed with—gives me thrills and chills.

691
00:57:15,775 --> 00:57:19,775
喰らっちゃっても本懐でしょ 最低だって滾るでしょ
Even if I'm consumed, it's what I wanted; even if it's the worst, it boils my blood, right?

692
00:57:19,775 --> 00:57:22,775
見透かして 見透かされて 故に
Seeing through, being seen through, and therefore...

693
00:57:22,775 --> 00:57:23,975
終わりは無い
...there is no end.

694
00:57:23,975 --> 00:57:27,775
高鳴るこの全てノンフィクション
All of this pounding thrill is non-fiction.

695
00:57:27,775 --> 00:57:32,275
堕ちても昇ってもノンフィクション！
Whether falling or ascending, it's non-fiction!

696
00:58:04,575 --> 00:58:07,775
中川に浮かぶ 夕日をめがけて
Aiming at the setting sun floating over the Naka River,

697
00:58:07,775 --> 00:58:11,275
小石を蹴ったら 靴まで飛んで
I kicked a pebble and my shoe flew off too.

698
00:58:11,275 --> 00:58:14,775
ジョギングしていた 大工の頭領に
The carpenter boss out for a jog

699
00:58:14,775 --> 00:58:18,575
ガキのまんまだい と笑われたのさ
Laughed at me, saying "You're still just a kid!"

700
00:58:18,775 --> 00:58:22,575
どこかに元気を 落っことしても
Even if I lose my high spirits somewhere,

701
00:58:22,575 --> 00:58:25,575
葛飾亀有 アクビをひとつ
Here in Kameari, Katsushika, with a single yawn,

702
00:58:25,575 --> 00:58:32,575
変わらない街並みが 妙にやさしいよ
The unchanging townscape feels strangely comforting.

703
00:58:46,575 --> 00:58:49,975
中央広場で 子供の手を引く
In the central plaza, holding her child's hand,

704
00:58:49,975 --> 00:58:54,275
太ったあの娘は 初恋の彼女
That plump woman was my first love.

705
00:58:54,575 --> 00:58:58,275
権八池で 渡したラブレター
The love letter I gave her at Gonpachi Pond,

706
00:58:58,275 --> 00:59:01,575
今も持ってると からかわれたよ
She teased me, saying she still has it.

707
00:59:01,775 --> 00:59:05,275
何にもいいこと なかったけど
Nothing good really happened today, but

708
00:59:05,275 --> 00:59:08,775
葛飾水元 流れる雲と
Here in Mizumoto, Katsushika, with the drifting clouds,

709
00:59:08,775 --> 00:59:15,775
ラプソディー口ずさみ 少し歩こうか
Humming a rhapsody, shall I walk a little while?

710
00:59:30,975 --> 00:59:34,575
カラスが鳴くから もう日が暮れるね
The crows are cawing, so the sun must be setting.

711
00:59:34,575 --> 00:59:37,975
焼き鳥ほおばり ビール飲もうか
Shall I munch on yakitori and drink a beer?

712
00:59:45,775 --> 00:59:49,575
トンガリ帽子の 取水塔から
From the intake tower shaped like a pointed hat,

713
00:59:49,575 --> 00:59:52,775
帝釈天へと 夕陽が落ちる
The evening sun sets towards Taishakuten.

714
00:59:52,775 --> 00:59:56,575
明日もこうして 終わるんだね
Tomorrow will probably end just like this too.

715
00:59:56,575 --> 01:00:02,775
葛飾柴又 倖せだって
Here in Shibamata, Katsushika, this too is happiness.

716
01:00:03,396 --> 01:00:07,296
明日もこうして 終わるんだね
Tomorrow will end like this too, won't it?

717
01:00:07,396 --> 01:00:10,796
葛飾柴又 幸せだって
Katsushika Shibamata, saying "I'm happy",

718
01:00:10,796 --> 01:00:13,396
なくして気がついた
I realized after losing it,

719
01:00:13,396 --> 01:00:16,896
バカな俺だから
because I'm such a fool.

720
01:00:17,396 --> 01:00:21,396
どこかに元気を 落っことしても
Even if I lose my spirit somewhere,

721
01:00:21,396 --> 01:00:25,196
葛飾亀有 あくびをひとつ
Katsushika Kameari, giving a single yawn,

722
01:00:25,396 --> 01:00:28,396
変わらない町並みが
the unchanging townscape

723
01:00:28,396 --> 01:00:31,396
妙にやさしいよ
is strangely gentle.

724
01:00:54,696 --> 01:00:59,896
アキロゼ生誕祭2026をご覧の皆さん、いかがでしたでしょうかー！
To everyone watching Aki Rose Birthday 2026, how was it?!

725
01:00:59,996 --> 01:01:06,896
さーて、ここからは大事なお知らせがあるので、最後までしっかり聞いていってね！
Now then, there are important announcements from here, so listen carefully until the end!

726
01:01:06,996 --> 01:01:13,896
まずはお知らせ1つ目！アキロゼ生誕祭2026誕生日グッズ発売でーす！
First, announcement number 1! Aki Rose Birthday 2026 Birthday Goods are now on sale!

727
01:01:14,396 --> 01:01:20,196
今回はライブの世界観をぎゅっと楽しんでもらえるグッズを頑張って制作いたしました！
This time, we worked hard to create merch that lets you fully enjoy the worldview of the live concert!

728
01:01:20,396 --> 01:01:27,896
なので、今回のライブが良かったなーって思った方はぜひ応援で購入していただくのもすごく嬉しいです！
So if you thought this live concert was great, I'd be super happy if you purchased them to support me!

729
01:01:28,396 --> 01:01:32,396
それでは、まず1つ目のグッズ！「Life is GAME ラバーマット」！
Now then, first merch item! "Life is GAME Rubber Mat"!

730
01:01:32,896 --> 01:01:38,396
今回のイラストはLAM先生に描き下ろしていただきました！素敵なイラストありがとうございます！
The illustration this time was newly drawn by LAM-sensei! Thank you so much for the wonderful illustration!

731
01:01:38,896 --> 01:01:47,896
今回のライブの世界観をイメージしたイラストになっています！めちゃくちゃセクシーで色っぽいけどかっこいいようなアキロゼになっています！
It's themed after the worldview of this live concert! It's an Aki Rose that's super sexy and alluring, yet cool!

732
01:01:48,396 --> 01:01:51,896
ラバーマットで思う存分楽しんでください！
Please enjoy it to your heart's content on this rubber mat!

733
01:01:52,196 --> 01:01:58,196
ちなみにサイズはカードゲームにぴったり！この意味、分かるよね？
By the way, the size is perfect for card games! You get what this means, right?

734
01:01:58,896 --> 01:02:04,196
2つ目のグッズが、「運命の5枚 タロット風アクリルスタンドセット」！
The second item is "5 Cards of Fate Tarot-style Acrylic Stand Set"!

735
01:02:04,396 --> 01:02:08,396
アキロゼがあなたのことを占って背中を押してあげます！
Aki Rose will divine your fortune and encourage you!

736
01:02:08,596 --> 01:02:14,896
1日の始まりや何か運命を託したいみたいなそんなときに、使って楽しむ、
At the start of your day, or when you want to entrust something to fate, you can use it...

737
01:02:15,196 --> 01:02:20,396
そして5枚バーンって飾っておけるので、見ても楽しめるようになっております！
and you can display all 5 cards prominently, so it's also fun to look at!

738
01:02:20,896 --> 01:02:27,896
占い方法は、この後紹介するアキロゼのASMRボイスと連動しております！
The fortune-telling method is linked with Aki Rose's ASMR voice pack that I'll introduce next!

739
01:02:28,396 --> 01:02:33,896
飾っても楽しい、使っても楽しい、そのような連動グッズになっているのでぜひGETしてください！
It's a linked item that's fun to display and fun to use, so please get it!

740
01:02:34,396 --> 01:02:40,396
続いてのグッズは、「アキロゼのトランプ」！作っちゃいましたー！
Next up is "Aki Rose's Playing Cards"! We actually made them!

741
01:02:41,396 --> 01:02:48,896
こちら、実際に遊んでいただけるトランプなので、たくさん予備も買ったほうがいいんじゃないかなーと思います！
These are real playing cards you can actually play with, so I think buying lots of spares might be a good idea!

742
01:02:49,396 --> 01:02:53,896
ぜひトランプでもアキロゼをたくさん楽しんでアピールもしてくださいね！
Please enjoy Aki Rose through playing cards and show them off to others too!

743
01:02:54,396 --> 01:02:57,896
続いてはこちら、「アキロゼのカードケース」！
Next up is this: "Aki Rose's Card Case"!

744
01:02:58,396 --> 01:03:05,196
ホロカはもちろん、トランプなど小物入れを入れても大丈夫です！ぜひお家や持ち歩きに使ってね！
Of course for Holoca, but it's also great for holding small items like playing cards! Please use it at home or on the go!

745
01:03:05,596 --> 01:03:12,196
そしてボイスの紹介です！今回もASMRボイスを特別に発売！
And now for the voice packs! This time, we're releasing special ASMR voice packs again!

746
01:03:12,396 --> 01:03:18,396
アキとロゼがそれぞれ左右からあなたのことを誘惑しちゃうかも？
Aki and Rose might tempt you from the left and right respectively!

747
01:03:18,896 --> 01:03:23,896
台本も頑張って書いたので、ぜひぜひたっぷり楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいです！
I worked hard writing the script, so I'd be super glad if you enjoy it to the fullest!

748
01:03:24,196 --> 01:03:30,896
こちらボイスは『Life is GAME ～アキロゼの盤上～』こちらをメインとし、
For these voice packs, "Life is GAME ~Aki Rose's Board~" is the main track,

749
01:03:30,896 --> 01:03:37,396
ASMRショートボイスとして先ほどの「運命の5枚 タロット風アクリルスタンド」と連動したショートボイスが入っております！
and as ASMR short voices, there are short voices linked to the "5 Cards of Fate Tarot-style Acrylic Stands"!

750
01:03:37,896 --> 01:03:44,596
ショートボイスのシャッフル・ランダム再生をして、選ばれたボイスがあなたの運命の1枚になります！
By playing the short voices on shuffle or random playback, the selected voice becomes your card of fate!

751
01:03:44,896 --> 01:03:47,896
ぜひ色々楽しんでね！
Please enjoy them in various ways!

752
01:03:48,196 --> 01:03:53,396
これからのグッズ全てが詰まったフルセット購入には、なんと特典もついております！
Purchasing the full set containing all these merch items comes with a bonus!

753
01:03:53,596 --> 01:03:58,396
今回のキービジュアルのイラストを使ったチケット風カードになっております！
It's a ticket-style card featuring the key visual illustration!

754
01:03:58,596 --> 01:04:06,396
あなたはこのゲームに参加する？参加したい？こちらもライブの世界観を高めるアイテムになっているのでぜひGETしてください！
Will you participate in this game? Do you want to join? This is also an item that enhances the live concert experience, so please get it!

755
01:04:06,596 --> 01:04:16,196
そして数量限定版あります！直筆サインとメッセージ入りチケット風カードになっております！頑張って書きます！
And there's a limited quantity version! It comes with a hand-written signature and message on the ticket-style card! I'll do my best writing them!

756
01:04:16,396 --> 01:04:26,396
そして数量限定版が終わり次第、箔押しでの複製サインとメッセージが入ったチケット風カードになります！ぜひフルセット購入特典GETしてね！
And once the limited quantity version sells out, it will be a ticket-style card with foil-stamped replicated signature and message! Make sure to get the full set bonus!

757
01:04:26,896 --> 01:04:34,196
大事な発売時間は、この後21時30分！21時30分にショップオープンです！
The important release time is today at 21:30! The shop opens at 21:30!

758
01:04:34,396 --> 01:04:38,896
ぜひ登録など準備して備えておいてね！
Please make preparations like registering in advance and be ready!

759
01:04:38,896 --> 01:04:41,396
続きましてお知らせ2つ目！
Moving on to announcement number 2!

760
01:04:41,596 --> 01:04:48,196
この後21時45分からメンバー限定のアフターライブをお送りします！
Starting from 21:45 today, we will be hosting a members-only After Live!

761
01:04:48,396 --> 01:04:53,896
ライブ本編とはまた違う楽曲を披露する予定なので、ぜひお楽しみに！
We plan to perform songs that are different from the main live concert, so please look forward to it!

762
01:04:54,196 --> 01:04:57,396
今日メンバーになった方もぜひぜひ見てね！
Anyone who became a member today, please check it out too!

763
01:04:57,596 --> 01:05:01,396
ちなみに過去のライブのメンバー限定アフター...
By the way, for past lives' members-only after...

764
01:05:02,121 --> 01:05:03,621
アフターライブも見れちゃうと思うので
I think you'll also be able to watch the after-live,

765
01:05:03,621 --> 01:05:06,921
ぜひそのあたりも見てもてねー
so please be sure to check that out as well!

766
01:05:07,221 --> 01:05:09,621
ちなみに今回のサムネイラストは
By the way, this time's thumbnail illustration

767
01:05:09,621 --> 01:05:12,121
メンバー限定で壁紙として
will be given out as a wallpaper

768
01:05:12,121 --> 01:05:14,621
プレゼント予定です！
exclusively to members!

769
01:05:14,621 --> 01:05:16,321
お楽しみに！
Look forward to it!

770
01:05:16,621 --> 01:05:18,121
そして！
And next...

771
01:05:18,121 --> 01:05:19,921
お知らせ3つ目！
The third announcement!

772
01:05:20,121 --> 01:05:23,921
本日の生誕祭ライブの後も
Even after today's Birthday Live...

773
01:05:24,121 --> 01:05:27,621
お楽しみはまだまだ続きます！
the fun is far from over!

774
01:05:27,621 --> 01:05:30,121
なんと！ホロアースにて
Believe it or not, in HoloEarth,

775
01:05:30,121 --> 01:05:32,121
特別企画！
a special event:

776
01:05:32,121 --> 01:05:38,621
アキ・ローゼンタール生誕祭2026 アンコール in ホロアース
"Aki Rosenthal Birthday Fest 2026 Encore in HoloEarth"

777
01:05:38,621 --> 01:05:40,321
を開催しまーす！
will be held!

778
01:05:40,321 --> 01:05:42,421
今回初披露した
I'll be singing my new song,

779
01:05:42,421 --> 01:05:45,421
新曲『モノポリー』をホロアースで歌っちゃいます！
"Monopoly", which was performed for the first time today, in HoloEarth!

780
01:05:45,421 --> 01:05:48,121
いろんな角度からアキロゼのパフォーマンスや
You can closely watch AkiRose's performance

781
01:05:48,121 --> 01:05:52,121
演出をじっくりと見てみてくださいね！
and stage effects from all kinds of angles!

782
01:05:52,121 --> 01:05:55,121
さらにホロアースだけのMCパートも
Plus, there'll be a generous MC segment

783
01:05:55,121 --> 01:05:57,121
たっぷりやるので
exclusive to HoloEarth,

784
01:05:57,121 --> 01:06:00,121
ぜひぜひ会いに来てください！
so please come see me!

785
01:06:00,121 --> 01:06:04,621
開催日は3月13日、3月13日です！
The date is March 13th, March 13th!

786
01:06:04,621 --> 01:06:08,621
詳細はホロアース公式Xをチェックしてね！
Check the official HoloEarth X account for details!

787
01:06:08,621 --> 01:06:10,921
そして最後のお知らせが
And our final announcement...

788
01:06:10,921 --> 01:06:13,421
新曲『モノポリー』！
My new song, "Monopoly"!

789
01:06:13,421 --> 01:06:17,121
本日日付が変わる頃にリリースされますので
It'll be released around midnight today,

790
01:06:17,121 --> 01:06:19,621
各音楽配信サービスから
so please buy and stream it

791
01:06:19,621 --> 01:06:23,921
ぜひ購入してね！たくさん聴いてね！
on all streaming services! Give it lots of listens!

792
01:06:24,121 --> 01:06:27,321
振付も歌もとってもキャッチーなので
Both the choreography and song are super catchy,

793
01:06:27,321 --> 01:06:30,121
覚えてみんなで楽しんでもらえる
so I hope you learn it and enjoy it together,

794
01:06:30,121 --> 01:06:34,921
愛されるような楽曲になってくれたら嬉しいなって思っています！
and that it becomes a beloved track for everyone!

795
01:06:35,321 --> 01:06:38,121
また後日ライブ配信で
Also, in a future stream,

796
01:06:38,121 --> 01:06:41,121
新曲『モノポリー』だったり
I'd like to talk about the new song "Monopoly,"

797
01:06:41,121 --> 01:06:44,621
今回のライブに触れた後日談などを語ったり
share behind-the-scenes stories about today's live,

798
01:06:44,621 --> 01:06:47,121
一緒に見たりなどしたいなと思ってるので
or watch it together with you all,

799
01:06:47,121 --> 01:06:50,121
ぜひチャンネル登録、高評価ぽちっ
so please subscribe to the channel, smash that like button,

800
01:06:50,121 --> 01:06:52,621
通知もオン！してなかった人は今ぽちっとね！
and turn on notifications! If you haven't, hit that button now!

801
01:06:52,621 --> 01:06:55,921
絶対絶対また会いに来てね！
Definitely, definitely come see me again!

802
01:06:55,921 --> 01:06:57,321
それでは...
And now...

803
01:06:57,321 --> 01:06:59,321
運命は時に残酷。
Fate is sometimes cruel.

804
01:06:59,321 --> 01:07:03,121
あなたが選びたくて選んだものではないかもしれない。
It may not be something you wanted to choose.

805
01:07:03,121 --> 01:07:04,621
だけど...
But...

806
01:07:04,621 --> 01:07:09,121
いつでもあなたの人生は...あなたのもの。
your life is always... yours.

807
01:07:09,121 --> 01:07:11,121
人生は一度きり。
You only live once.

808
01:07:11,121 --> 01:07:14,121
やり直しのきかないこのゲーム、
In this game where there are no retries,

809
01:07:14,121 --> 01:07:17,621
あなたはどう楽しむ？
how will you enjoy it?

